        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"50242c88-24e5-419c-9208-a95b061f9e13\",\"review_text\":\"Hey from few days ago I am running from bug in this app after playing few music it automatically stop music and didn't start until I restart it So plz fix this bug\"},{\"review_id\":\"affc6b42-ea5a-4825-8891-77bec773b8f6\",\"review_text\":\"3rd class App MF Swedon\"},{\"review_id\":\"85ab63b9-4a26-4919-a042-4cb50bb29967\",\"review_text\":\"♥️♥️♥️\"},{\"review_id\":\"04ea0f0c-287d-4b52-a9ab-419bd4e704bf\",\"review_text\":\"I aggree with the users. They also bugged the lite version, means horribly not login with the mobile number. What the bug is it. Please fix it. Also the specific part skipping is in premium. It it goes like this, the normal users , who cover a major part will lose the app. Hope this bug will fix soon or else we would have to shift to another app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d3371b7-5242-4c82-9624-48faafdf00e5\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify never let's u down when it comes to music quality only problem is the ads but I guess u just gotta go premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"cb316cfb-2e8d-456a-bca4-39b9fba8bf22\",\"review_text\":\"What is this Spotify? Do you know the meaning of 'Sar Tan Se Juda' slogan? It's an open call for beheading. Why is Spotify promoting radicalization?\"},{\"review_id\":\"1964a1c6-98e4-41d0-8417-b32fc1a728f2\",\"review_text\":\"It consume much net.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3686ac77-b132-42b6-87ea-e5d8fd66d383\",\"review_text\":\"I cannot pay on the app, \\\"unable to connect\\\"\"},{\"review_id\":\"c9d96ac8-e705-4364-9f04-19c87c90e398\",\"review_text\":\"😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"c1e7756f-8e08-4298-bd6b-300082f9ab98\",\"review_text\":\"App is completely build with bugs ... seeking bar is not working. And the couldn't shuffle songs without premium account\"}]}"
